# Module Scope Conventions

Use `src/modules/auth` as the reference structure:

- `pages/<page>/index.tsx` for each page.
- `pages/<page>/components/*` for page-local UI.
- `atoms/*` for module state.
- `layout/*` for module-specific layout wrappers.
- `types/*` and `utils/*` for module contracts/helpers.

## Required patterns

- Organize by domain scope (`auth`, `brands`, `categories`, `checkout`, `discovery`).
- Keep page logic close to its page folder.
- Keep module imports lower-case (e.g. `@/modules/auth/...`).

## Prohibited patterns

- Mixing `Auth` and `auth` path casing.
- Adding `route-entry` folders for page resolution.
- Creating a global type dump for module-local types.
